</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Replay master: Automatic sample selection and effective memory
utilization for continual semantic segmentation.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib84.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence</span>,
2025.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib85" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[85]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Lanyun Zhu, Deyi Ji, Tianrun Chen, Haiyang Wu, De Wen Soh, and Jun Liu.

</span>
